## PixelVariance, then Clipping and a Sphere, so a mis-counted read
## desyncs the next parse. Not third-party.
Display "pixelvariance.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
PixelVariance 0.05
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
